{"review_id": "d7c13950-d1fa-4696-b475-10cbcf3e4373", "package": "com.superbyte.habitrabbit", "app_name": "Habit Rabbit: Habit Tracker", "language": "fr", "language_name": "French", "rating": 5, "text": "I looove this app! And Study Bunny as well :) Those are the only productivity apps that work for me and actually get me motivated! Suggestion: could we have a vacation mode for some habits only instead of a \"general\" vacation mode for all of them? For instance I have a chronic illness and if I'm feeling sick I won't do some of my habits (ex: running), but I'd like to keep track of my other habits.", "author": "Milica Miljus", "date": "2022-01-10T16:38:22Z", "thumbs_up": 4, "app_version": "1.32", "developer_reply": null}
