{"review_id": "ce334817-667e-41ec-aaed-1fc74894aa93", "package": "com.superbyte.habitrabbit", "app_name": "Habit Rabbit: Habit Tracker", "language": "fr", "language_name": "French", "rating": 4, "text": "I really loved the study bunny so i downloaded this one to see how it is like. I've liked it so far but for me, all my medicines would be \"high priority tasks\" but i just can add 1 high priority and 2 medium priority tasks, so i guess this could be a suggestion for a future update.", "author": "Talita Andrade", "date": "2021-10-20T13:44:50Z", "thumbs_up": 6, "app_version": "1.15", "developer_reply": null}
{"review_id": "b2fefc00-17fd-4bc3-9cfe-30ac7045b8aa", "package": "com.superbyte.habitrabbit", "app_name": "Habit Rabbit: Habit Tracker", "language": "fr", "language_name": "French", "rating": 5, "text": "Super appli ! Je connaissais déjà study bunny que j'aime beaucoup et je ne suis pas déçue de Habit Rabbit! Hate de voir les prochaines mises à jour. En suggestion : ce serait bien de faire, en plus des objectifs par semaine, des objectifs quotidiens.", "author": "Gaby Czt", "date": "2021-10-06T16:50:45Z", "thumbs_up": 36, "app_version": "1.11", "developer_reply": null}
